sub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></p>","file":"ch06-polynomials/06-interpolation-and-crt.html"}